# The CV is published as ciphertext only (cv/resume.enc). The plaintext contains
# a phone number that is deliberately absent from the public site, and this repo
# is public -- a single accidental `git add` would put it in the history forever,
# where deleting the file later does not remove it. So the plaintext is barred
# from the repo entirely; keep your working copy outside it (~/sandbox/cv).
